{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37384","headline":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 七 · 唐彦谦","name":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年秋事荒，贩籴仰邻州。\n健者道路间，什百成朋俦。\n今年渐向熟，庶几民不流。\n书生自无田，与衆同喜忧。\n作诗劳邻曲，有倡谁与詶。\n亦无采诗者，此修何可修。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}